statement error correlated subquery would evaluate the impure outer expression
SELECT s.id, (SELECT count(*) FROM correlated_aggregate_facts f WHERE f.id = s.id)
FROM (SELECT id FROM correlated_aggregate_outer ORDER BY random() LIMIT 50) s;

statement error correlated subquery would evaluate the impure outer expression
